In the goldenland-realestate-v2 repo, the code-review skill reviews uncommitted work against a fixed point (HEAD for uncommitted changes) and the originating issue as spec source. Review findings are recorded in docs/agents/reviews/<issue-number>.md. The `.pi-subagents/` directory is pi-generated noise and must be gitignored. <!-- created=2026-08-06, last=2026-08-06 -->
§
When using the implement skill, after committing work the agent must follow the repo's issue-tracker convention: close the originating ticket with a comment and append a context pointer (e.g., to the map's 'Implementation Decisions' section) before marking done. Skipping this step is a miss the user will call out. <!-- created=2026-08-06, last=2026-08-06 -->
