In pi-subagents, AGENTS.md delegation rules are advisory: the extension exposes a callable subagent tool but does not automatically delegate or police primary repository tools. Reliable mandatory delegation requires a primary-side runtime guard (for example a global extension intercepting tool_call). <!-- created=2026-08-06, last=2026-08-06 -->
